            "review_title": "Review at Relax Garden",
            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nA most fantastic lunch.\nAug 2019 • Couples\nIt is too bad that a tourist won’t be able to find this restaurant because the food and surroundings are tremendous. Also the name relax garden only appears on your receipt. \n\nWalking down a dirt road, prior to any signage, you reach the restaurant. It is on the river. Walking across a series of wooden piers you reach your table.\n\nOverhead is a straw covering with tropical foliage surrounding you. \n\nFor lunch we ordered fish soup, bahn xeo hai san(with seafood), and bahn xeo mien tua with a crispy rice pancake and fish that is spread on the pancake. We also had peach tea with chia seeds. All of these dishes were absolutely delicious. \n\nService was friendly and accommodating and the cost was reasonable extremely reasonable.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
