            "review_text": "C D\n53 contributions\n0\nVery relaxing place!\nJan 2019 • Friends\nGreat choice of places for Sunday afternoon! After a very busy week and best earn relaxing lunch or dinner choice! Very green area! Drinking coconut was a great fun! Seafood and loads of green leaves with authentic Vietnamese dishes were divine! Very healthy food choice too! Highly recommend this place to anyone 👍🏽😀\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 26, 2019",
