            "review_title": "Review at Relax Garden",
            "review_text": "Thuyen T\nTampa, Florida70 contributions\n0\nSouthern countryside style cuisine\nAug 2018 • Friends\nSince I’m from the south, I really like this restaurant. The scene is nice and relaxing, and food is great too. I’m not sure if we can fish there but my friend said that if we go in big party, we can request the traditional southern singing (đờn ca tài tử) for extra fee. I would love to come back there next time I’m in Vietnam. Hopefully they are still open despite the rapid developing.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2018",
